---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Privacy Policy | 48 Hours in California';
const pageDescription =
  'Privacy Policy for 48 Hours in California.';
---

<Base title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <section>
    <p>48 Hours in California</p>

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
      48 Hours in California respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy
      explains the types of information that may be collected when you visit
      our website and how that information may be used.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

    <p>
      We may collect information that you voluntarily provide to us, such as
      when you contact us, subscribe to communications, or otherwise interact
      with the website.
    </p>

    <p>
      We may also receive general information about how visitors use the site,
      such as pages visited, referring websites, browser type, device type,
      and similar website usage information.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>

    <p>
      48 Hours in California may use cookies, analytics services, and similar
      technologies to understand website traffic, improve the site, and
      measure the usefulness of our content.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links and Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
      Our website may contain links to hotels, tours, attractions, restaurants,
      travel services, retailers, and other third-party websites. Some of these
      may be affiliate links, which means we may earn a commission if you make
      a qualifying purchase or booking through one of our links, at no
      additional cost to you.
    </p>

    <p>
      Third-party websites and services have their own privacy practices and
      policies. 48 Hours in California is not responsible for the privacy
      practices or content of those third-party websites.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>

    <p>
      Information collected through the website may be used to operate and
      improve 48 Hours in California, understand how visitors use our content,
      respond to inquiries, and support our travel recommendations and
      services.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy as the website grows or as the services
      and technologies we use change. Updates will be posted on this page.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us
      through our Contact page.
    </p>

    <p><em>Last updated: September 2026.</em></p>
  </section>
</Base>
